			"color": "5",
			"text": "## 🧑‍💻 Browser\n\nNext.js client components\nTanStack Query · typed `openapi-fetch`\n\nCalls same-origin `/api/*` only"
		},
		{
			"id": "a1f0000000000003",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## ▲ Next.js 16\n\nApp Router · Tailwind v4 design system\nServer-side rewrite `/api/*` → `API_URL`\n\n[[ADR-0005 Next.js proxies the API]]"
		},
		{
