			"y": 0,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "5",
			"text": "## ⚡ FastAPI\n\nPydantic v2 · error contract · request ids\n`/api/health` `/api/ready` `/api/countries` `/api/sources/status`"
